	<name>2556 Haste St · 556 units · 2 buildings · site · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 389 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 50 m at radius 177 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (40.2 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
